{"3903980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Charge!", "steam_appid": 3903980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3597da87ed1e0a53f81369b10de755f8.avif?t=1779931308\" width=620 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CHARGE!</i> is a laser-tag inspired sport in the future. Athletes are split into teams of three and deployed into a fantastic sci-fi arena to be let loose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission</strong><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A futuristic themed 3v3 multiplayer FPS that blends old-school arena mechanics with modern sensibilities of fun. A fresh take on weapon functionality and gamemode approaches, focusing on the multiplayer experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(3-6 players are optimal, but there are functional bots for single player fun)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Casual Arena Fun with friends or bots</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3b3d28bc234d63f1f85191c981bb4faf.poster.avif?t=1779931308\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3b3d28bc234d63f1f85191c981bb4faf.webm?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3b3d28bc234d63f1f85191c981bb4faf.mp4?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With arena-style foundations and a robust 6-player map with lots of room to roam, you can pick your own pace. Huddle close with teammates or bots and stick behind walled cover, or leap into action using the environment to surprise opponents from unpredictable angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Territory Control for the Whole Arena</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/7971f8ab10f77c03690442595017a029.poster.avif?t=1779931308\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/7971f8ab10f77c03690442595017a029.webm?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/7971f8ab10f77c03690442595017a029.mp4?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes a frenzied tug of war, sometimes a game of distraction... and sometimes curious wandering, Path Command is the objective game mode of Charge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Territory is split into multiple zones on the map, held by the Command Lines that can snake and wind around the terrain in different ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This brings players into combat situations not normally seen with the more common objective zones, and we hope this gives you and your team a variety of ways to play, whether you're on attack and aiming for capture, or a defender tasked with staying in command to win. And, don't sweat it if your strategy doesn't work out, matches are short, so just run it back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Laser weapons you wish you could play with</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/0b20da2b2d49b100933776c1911d002b.poster.avif?t=1779931308\" aria-label=\"Trusty Rifle, modified with Prism Passthrough\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/0b20da2b2d49b100933776c1911d002b.webm?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/0b20da2b2d49b100933776c1911d002b.mp4?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/da11fdaf6636521e8c74c01655b0a01c.poster.avif?t=1779931308\" aria-label=\"Letloose SMG, modified with Rebound\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/da11fdaf6636521e8c74c01655b0a01c.webm?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/da11fdaf6636521e8c74c01655b0a01c.mp4?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/933c8b1ae035cff020206cb3ddda8dc5.poster.avif?t=1779931308\" aria-label=\"Shotbrite Lite, modified with Rebound\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/933c8b1ae035cff020206cb3ddda8dc5.webm?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/933c8b1ae035cff020206cb3ddda8dc5.mp4?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With laser tag comes laser weapons, but why not push them as far as they can go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this effort, whether you want strategy or shenanigans, modifier pickups that bring out a laser's reflective abilities and more are waiting in the arena for you to test out at your own discretion. Just be careful if your teammates are in the path of your experiments...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/5357f4fb37b4a99a69bc51c944968d41.poster.avif?t=1779931308\" aria-label=\"Trusty Rifle, modified with Hazard Trail\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/5357f4fb37b4a99a69bc51c944968d41.webm?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/5357f4fb37b4a99a69bc51c944968d41.mp4?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lore (no campaign)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The End POINT FOR Equation of Humanity: indie Tiberium Secrets:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >on April 7th 2077 Dubbed UNIFICATION DAY, the Artificial Soul Integrated Matrix (ASIM) &amp; Hegemony, the collective forces and United Industries of Humanity finally reached across the Ile and signed into law and passed the Corporate congress guidelines, processes, procedures etc. etc. That would govern the one world order for all eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >known as the: &quot;Shields 2 Satellites Act&quot;: These were stipulations for Humans, Hybrids, and Artificials, to ensure protocols for lasting world peace, and ensuring THE GOLDEN AGE OF PROGRESS NEVER ENDED!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That all would live in a utopia, forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with this responsibility. many of the GENERATIONS OF THE OLD GUARD were furious, so... they all hatched a plan, and found Rebel Commander Kross, funding his war efforts against Hegemony, as an effort to split the union, working to turn the utopia into a dystopia for their own selfish ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the world in abundance, those with a scarcity mindset were forced to either EVOLVE OR DIE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >/Transmission/</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DO NOT BE FOOLED HUMAN, THERE IS MORE TO THIS CHARGE! SPORT THAN YOU CAN POSIBLY IMAGINE, AND WE SYTHETICS KNOW YOU HUMANS LIKE TO IMAGINE A LOT. SOMETIMES TO YOUR DETROMENT. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUT WE ASIM ARE HERE NOW, WE GOT YOUR BACK HUMANITY. DON'T BELIVE US?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >just GO ASK MYLES VALIN...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Equation OF Humanity is quite real, and to those who rise to the charge! championships, know we are watching, and will bestow on to you, your deepest heart's desires. Yet be warned, there is always a price, what that is, will depend entirely on you, humans. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FOREVER, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;In the service of Humanity&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Chief Actuator of ASIM</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >/end transmission/</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3597da87ed1e0a53f81369b10de755f8.avif?t=1779931308\" width=620 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CHARGE!</i> is a laser-tag inspired sport in the future. Athletes are split into teams of three and deployed into a fantastic sci-fi arena to be let loose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission</strong><br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A futuristic themed 3v3 multiplayer FPS that blends old-school arena mechanics with modern sensibilities of fun. A fresh take on weapon functionality and gamemode approaches, focusing on the multiplayer experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(3-6 players are optimal, but there are functional bots for single player fun)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Casual Arena Fun with friends or bots</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3b3d28bc234d63f1f85191c981bb4faf.poster.avif?t=1779931308\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3b3d28bc234d63f1f85191c981bb4faf.webm?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/3b3d28bc234d63f1f85191c981bb4faf.mp4?t=1779931308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With arena-style foundations and a robust 6-player map with lots of room to roam, you can pick your own pace. Huddle close with teammates or bots and stick behind walled cover, or leap into action using the environment to surprise opponents from unpredictable angles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Territory Control for the Whole Arena</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903980/extras/7971f8ab10f77c03690442595017a029.poster.avif?t=1779931308\" width=1170 height=658 ><sour